        "id": "ADR-087",
        "title": "DreamGraph Explorer consistency and mutation safety model",
        "date": "2026-04-27T22:41:16.838Z",
        "decided_by": "collaborative",
        "status": "accepted",
        "context": {
          "problem": "DreamGraph Explorer introduces a live graph view, SSE event stream, and curated mutation endpoints. Without explicit guard rails, future changes could weaken instance isolation, break optimistic concurrency, or create ambiguous client consistency semantics between snapshot state and live events.",
