        "status": "accepted",
        "context": {
          "problem": "Some registered DreamGraph resources are backed by JSON files that may not exist yet during bootstrap or in intentionally inert configurations. Clients should see stable resource semantics instead of bootstrap-state failures such as ENOENT or INVALID_URI when the resource is known but its backing file has not been created yet.",
