        "decided_by": "human",
        "status": "accepted",
        "context": {
          "problem": "The architect uses one generic prompt for every coding task. Role-specific prompts (Reviewer, Debugger, Refactorer, Performance, Security, Reliability) would let the architect pull task-appropriate evidence and follow task-appropriate query protocols, but announcing the role in prose (\"I am now Security Architect\") becomes gimmicky and erodes trust over time.",
