        },
        "decision": {
          "chosen": "Add a buildHistoryIndex() + cycleFromIso() helper pair in both cognitive/causal.ts and cognitive/temporal.ts. Both consume engine.loadDreamHistory(), build a sorted {ts, cycle}[] index from per-cycle generated_at, and binary-search for the largest ts <= target ISO. All trajectory anchors and CausalLink.first_observed/last_observed derive from real ISO via this pair. The currentCycle - ttl and original.occurrences heuristics are removed. Rejected alternatives: extracting a shared helper now (broadens scope), persisting resolution_cycle on ResolvedTension at write time (schema migration), recomputing cycle from a synthetic monotonic counter (the bug being removed).",
