            "candidate futures",
            "future-fit score",
            "future objections",
            "future review decisions",
            "future supersession status",
            "model provenance",
            "fallback reason",
            "ADR-203",
            "ADR-204"
          ]
        },
        "decision": {
          "chosen": "Lock AFE plan review records to a provenance-rich, advisory schema that at minimum captures: candidate future identity, future-fit score and evidence, future objections, known prior future outcomes, model provenance, fallback reason when applicable, human review decision, review timestamp/actor context, and supersession status or replacement linkage. These records inform planning and review, but they do not become hard constraints or durable accepted architecture unless separately crystallized into ADRs or other durable project entities after review.",
