            "/api/architect/v1/chat",
            "standalone_architect_browser_shell"
          ]
        },
        "decision": {
          "chosen": "The standalone Architect chat endpoint is POST-only at /api/architect/v1/chat with application/json request bodies. GET requests to that endpoint are rejected with 405 Allow: POST, and the browser chat requests text/event-stream responses over the same POST request when streaming is requested. Plan browsing and other read-only navigation may remain GET.",
