              "option": "Use EventSource GET directly for prompt submission",
              "rejected_because": "EventSource is GET-based and cannot safely carry prompt text without URL leakage."
            },
            {
              "option": "Keep JSON-only POST responses",
              "rejected_because": "It is safe for prompt transport but does not satisfy the browser Architect streaming response path needed for longer model runs."
            }
          ]
        },
        "consequences": {
          "expected": [
            "Prompt text stays in POST bodies instead of URLs.",
            "Browser Architect can request SSE responses without using GET for prompts.",
            "Daemon remains the authority for chat handling, plan context, and audit events.",
            "Future provider/model selection work has a clear transport rule for prompt-bearing browser operations."
