              "option": "Use one global wall timeout",
              "rejected_because": "It cannot identify blocked stages and may terminate healthy long-running governed tools."
            },
            {
              "option": "Increase all existing timeout defaults",
              "rejected_because": "It hides transport or progress failures and compounds stacked waiting."
            },
